            <title xml:id="name5630-2" xml:lang="syr" srophe:tags="#syriaca-headword" source="#bib5630-5">ܡ̈ܕܪܫܐ ܕܝܠܗ ܟܕ ܕܝܠܗ ܕܩܕܝܫܐ ܡܪܝ ܐܦܪܝܡ ܕܥܐܕܐ ܕܕܢܚܐ</title>
            <title xml:id="name5630-3" xml:lang="en" source="#bib5630-5">Hymns of Ephraim on the Epiphany</title>
